    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"fixed-width\" ac:breakout-mode=\"default\"><ac:layout-cell><p /></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\" ac:breakout-mode=\"wide\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Purpose and Benefits</h2><p>Bahmni supports import of </p><ol><li><p>Concept reference terms </p></li><li><p>Add new Reference Terms to Existing Concepts</p></li></ol><h4>1. Concept reference terms </h4><p>New Concept reference terms can be created by uploading a </p><p class=\"media-group\"><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"view-file\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"d7fb1126-02c8-4273-969c-748cc2058987\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"name\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"conceptReferenceTerms.csv\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><p> file containing the below mentioned fields:</p><p /><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"a398ef0e-4031-4d4c-8e9c-b9ae3b1bff4b\"><tbody><tr><th data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f0f0\"><p>Key</p></th><th data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f0f0\"><p>Use</p></th><th data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f0f0\"><p>Mandatory</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Code</strong></p></td><td><p>Reference Term Code</p></td><td><p><strong>&nbsp;Y</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Source</strong></p></td><td><p>Name of the Reference Source</p></td><td><p><strong>&nbsp;Y</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Name</strong></p></td><td><p>Name of the concept reference term</p></td><td><p><strong>N</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>description</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>N</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Version</strong></p></td><td><p /></td><td><p><strong>N</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4>2. Add new Reference Terms to Existing Concepts</h4><p>User should be able to add new concept reference mapping for a pre-existing concept by uploading a</p><p class=\"media-group\"><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"view-file\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f1e9cefc-66b7-406e-8e6f-4c79d47525b5\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"name\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"AddRefTermToConcept.csv\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><p>file  containing the below mentioned fields:</p><p><br /></p><table data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"bdc451c2-233a-4fe0-a51e-595ca54ae810\"><tbody><tr><th data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f0f0\"><p>Key</p></th><th data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f0f0\"><p>Use</p></th><th data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f0f0\"><p>Mandatory</p></th></tr><tr><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>concept-name</strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p>Existing Concept Name</p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>&nbsp;Y</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>reference-term-source</strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p>Name of the Reference Source</p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>&nbsp;Y</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>reference-term-code</strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p>Reference term code</p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>Y</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>reference-term-relationship</strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p>&nbsp;Reference Term Mapping</p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\"><p><strong>Y</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"f59fa422-1838-4367-89b7-75a940e428e5\" ac:macro-id=\"2a90dbf3-269e-435c-9577-3218814125d5\" /></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
